<html lang='vi'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Lời mời tham gia workspace</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style='
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f1f5fc;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #070b14;
    '
  >
    <table
      role='presentation'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      width='100%'
      style='background-color: #f1f5fc; margin: 0; padding: 40px 0;'
    >
      <tr>
        <td align='center' style='padding: 0 16px;'>
          <table
            role='presentation'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            width='100%'
            style='
              max-width: 620px;
              background-color: #ffffff;
              border: 1px solid #d4d8de;
              border-radius: 20px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(7, 11, 20, 0.08);
            '
          >
            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style='
                  padding: 36px 40px 32px;
                  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #05070d 0%, #0a1018 60%, #0f1c33 100%);
                  border-bottom: 1px solid #1a2540;
                '
              >
                <div
                  style='
                    display: inline-block;
                    margin-bottom: 20px;
                    padding: 5px 14px;
                    border-radius: 999px;
                    background-color: rgba(57, 123, 233, 0.15);
                    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 123, 233, 0.3);
                    color: #397be9;
                    font-size: 11px;
                    line-height: 16px;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
                    text-transform: uppercase;
                  '
                >
                  {{appName}}
                </div>

                <h1
                  style='
                    margin: 0 0 10px;
                    font-size: 28px;
                    line-height: 36px;
                    color: #f1f5fc;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
                  '
                >
                  🎉 Bạn được mời tham gia!
                </h1>

                <p
                  style='
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 24px;
                    color: #8899bb;
                  '
                >
                  Bạn có một lời mời đang chờ xác nhận.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Body -->
            <tr>
              <td style='padding: 40px;'>
                <p
                  style='
                    margin: 0 0 16px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 26px;
                    color: #3a4460;
                  '
                >
                  Xin chào
                  <strong style='color: #070b14;'>{{recipientName}}</strong>,
                </p>

                <p
                  style='
                    margin: 0 0 32px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 28px;
                    color: #4a5578;
                  '
                >
                  <strong style='color: #070b14;'>{{inviterName}}</strong> đã mời bạn tham gia workspace
                  <strong style='color: #070b14;'>{{workspaceName}}</strong> với vai trò
                  <strong style='color: #1c50a7;'>{{roleName}}</strong>.
                  Nhấn vào nút bên dưới để chấp nhận lời mời.
                </p>

                <!-- CTA Button -->
                <table
                  role='presentation'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  width='100%'
                  style='margin: 0 0 36px;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td align='center'>
                      <a
                        href='{{acceptUrl}}'
                        target='_blank'
                        style='
                          display: inline-block;
                          min-width: 220px;
                          padding: 16px 36px;
                          border-radius: 12px;
                          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1c50a7 0%, #397be9 100%);
                          color: #ffffff;
                          text-decoration: none;
                          font-size: 16px;
                          line-height: 20px;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          letter-spacing: 0.01em;
                          box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(28, 80, 167, 0.35);
                        '
                      >
                        Chấp nhận lời mời →
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Info card -->
                <table
                  role='presentation'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  width='100%'
                  style='
                    margin: 0 0 28px;
                    background-color: #f8fafd;
                    border: 1px solid #d4d8de;
                    border-radius: 14px;
                  '
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style='padding: 22px 24px;'>
                      <p
                        style='
                          margin: 0 0 14px;
                          font-size: 11px;
                          line-height: 18px;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          letter-spacing: 0.08em;
                          text-transform: uppercase;
                          color: #8899bb;
                        '
                      >
                        Chi tiết lời mời
                      </p>
                      <table role='presentation' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' width='100%'>
                        <tr>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #8899bb; width: 90px;'>Workspace</td>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #070b14; font-weight: 600;'>{{workspaceName}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4e8ef; font-size: 14px; color: #8899bb;'>Người mời</td>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4e8ef; font-size: 14px; color: #070b14; font-weight: 600;'>{{inviterName}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4e8ef; font-size: 14px; color: #8899bb;'>Vai trò</td>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4e8ef; font-size: 14px; color: #1c50a7; font-weight: 600;'>{{roleName}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4e8ef; font-size: 14px; color: #8899bb;'>Hết hạn</td>
                          <td style='padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4e8ef; font-size: 14px; color: #c0392b; font-weight: 600;'>{{expiredAt}}</td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p
                  style='
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    line-height: 24px;
                    color: #8899bb;
                  '
                >
                  Nếu bạn không mong đợi email này, hãy bỏ qua nó. Không có thay đổi nào được thực hiện.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style='
                  padding: 24px 40px;
                  border-top: 1px solid #e4e8ef;
                  background-color: #f8fafd;
                  text-align: center;
                '
              >
                <p
                  style='
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 20px;
                    color: #8899bb;
                  '
                >
                  © {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>